    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 12.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">ne na ma wifa þonne an hæbbe, ac beo be þære anre, þa hwile þe heo libbe, se þe wille Godes lage gyman mid rihte ⁊ wiþ hellebryne beorgan his sawle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and he shall never have more wives than one, but he who seeks to observe God's law aright and to save his soul from hell-fire shall remain with the one as long as she lives.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
